    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "Thu4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Why does everyone like Maru so much? Sure, she's smart and friendly, but don't they realize it's all just an attention-grabbing scam?#$e#Sorry...$s",
      "translation": "Proč mají všichni Maru tolik rádi? Jistě, je chytrá a přátelská, ale copak nevidí, že je to jen trik, jak na sebe strhnout pozornost?#$e#Promiň...$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "5e448929b565e957dc74b2140bb4c31542b7ff8ba7418211976f70465bf3d276",
      "translationSHA256": "097e83bfefa0d2f13277383d7f2ffada7d51a05f5a4a8ea4824ad6caefaa6b8e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
